% Unknown word in a K: field.  parsekey() (parseabc.c) warned about a word
% it could not parse only after its loop over the words of the field, so
% only for the last word: here "xyz" is followed by a clef and was dropped
% without a warning.  It is now reported:
% Ignoring string 'xyz' in K: field
X:1
T:Unknown word in K:
C:abc2midi test
M:4/4
L:1/4
K:G xyz clef=treble
G A B c|
